{"code":0,"data":{"job_post_detail":{"id":"7671129158815451398","title":"图像处理工程师","description":"负责从Sensor Raw数据到最终成片的全链路画质工程落地。\n1. 基于手机相机ISP架构、相机模组特性与算法原理，驱动影调、降噪、色彩、对焦等核心模块达到行业顶级水准；\n2. 负责图像质量解决方案的设计与研发，涵盖图像算法、效果调优、系统实现，具体包括ISP Pipeline与3A（AWB/AE/AF）模块的算法及效果开发，推进denoise、sharpness、HDR、superNight、LTM等核心算法的迭代升级；\n3. 负责影像新功能预研与产品卖点落地；\n4. 跟踪计算摄影、AI影像算法、多摄融合等行业技术趋势；参与新Sensor、ISP芯片等硬件平台的技术预研与效果调优，推动前沿技术方案量产落地","requirement":"1. 电子/计算机/图像处理/摄影/光学相关专业， 本科及以上学历；\r\n2. 了解android驱动和框架，了解图像处理和图像质量的基本概念；\r\n3. 热爱摄影，关注手机等消费类电子产品；\r\n4. 英语听说读写良好。","recruit_type":{"id":"201","name":"正式","en_name":"Regular","i18n_name":"正式","depth":2,"parent":{"id":"2","name":"校招","en_name":"Campus","i18n_name":"校招","depth":1,"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"publish_time":1786073972888,"channel_online_status":1,"job_subject":{"id":"7659311908839262514","name":{"zh_cn":"2027届校园招聘计划","i18n":"2027届校园招聘计划"},"limit_count":2,"active_status":1},"job_function":{"id":"7178759516879405165","name":"软件研发类","en_name":"Software R\u0026D","i18n_name":"软件研发类"},"job_id":"7671129158815287558","city_list":[{"code":"CT_11","name":"北京","en_name":"Beijing","location_type":3,"i18n_name":"北京","py_name":"beijing","mdm_code":"MDCY00000001","node_status":1},{"code":"CT_107","name":"南京","en_name":"Nanjing","location_type":3,"i18n_name":"南京","py_name":"nanjing","mdm_code":"MDCY00000121","node_status":1},{"code":"CT_128","name":"深圳","en_name":"Shenzhen","location_type":3,"i18n_name":"深圳","py_name":"shenzhen","mdm_code":"MDCY00000249","node_status":1}],"job_post_info":{"recruitment_type":{"id":"201","name":"正式","en_name":"Regular","i18n_name":"正式","depth":2,"parent":{"id":"2","name":"校招","en_name":"Campus","i18n_name":"校招","depth":1,"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"HighlightList":[],"JobChannelPublishList":[],"job_post_object_value_map":{},"address_list":[],"city_list":[],"correlation_job_